      "is": "IS 10124 (Part 8):1988",
      "clause": "4",
      "title": "Marking",
      "text": "4. Marking —The bend shall be marked in colour as indicated below for different class of fittings— Class of Fitting Colour Class 2 (0.4 MPa) Blue Class 3 (0.6 MPa) Green Class 4 (1.0 MPa) Yellow Note 1— For 0.25 MPa pressure class, fabricated bends should not be made from 0.25 MPa pressure class pipes. For this, bends made from 0.4 MPa pressure class pipe should be used. Note 2—Y is calculated from × 2 π r, where r, radius of the bend is equal to 3 times the nominal outside diameter (D) For detailed information, refer to IS  10124 (Part 8) : 1988 Specification for  fabricated PVC fittings for potable water supplies: Part 8  Specific requirements for 90 o bends. (first revision). FIG. 1 90O BEND r o 360 90",
